# Color Bar Title

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:plotly_ex, "~> 0.3"},
  {:kino, "~> 0.18"}
])
```

## Section

`colorbar: %{title: %{text: "...", side: "..."}}` adds a title to the colour bar.
`side:` accepts `"right"` (default), `"top"`, or `"bottom"`.

```elixir
alias Plotly.{Figure, Contour}

z = for i <- 0..19 do
  for j <- 0..19 do
    :math.sin(i * :math.pi() / 10) * :math.cos(j * :math.pi() / 10)
  end
end

Figure.new()
|> Figure.add_trace(
  Contour.new(
    z: z,
    colorscale: "Hot",
    colorbar: %{
      title: %{text: "Amplitude", side: "right"}
    }
  )
)
|> Figure.update_layout(title: "Contour — Color Bar Title")
|> Plotly.show()
```
